"P946198095" "{PlayerSource} shreds you with a Full Auto Barrage for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Beam Rifle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P579523066" "Beam Rifle"
// DisplayHelp :
"P461741102" "Your weapon of choice is a high tech beam rifle capable of firing a wide variety of energy blasts at your foes. Your Beam Rifle attacks will have greater potency while Disintegration is in effect on your target.  Additionally, single target Beam Rifle attacks used on targets suffering from the Disintegrating effect have a chance to spread this effect to nearby foes.  Beam Rifle focuses on dealing a great deal of single target damage, but has a few area of effect attacks as well."
// SetAccountTooltip :
"P259518364" "Please purchase this powerset in the Paragon Market to gain access to this feature."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Single Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P372881666" "Single Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2140791329" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe Knockdown, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P370108719" "You fire a single blast from your Beam Rifle which deals Moderate Energy damage and has a chance to knock the target down.  If the target is suffering from Disintegrate, Single Shot will reduce the target's regeneration rate slightly.  In addition, targets already affected by the Disintegrating effect have a chance to spread to 3 nearby targets.  This Spread Disintegration effect can only hit targets that aren't already affected by the Disintegration effect.  Spread Disintegration causes Minor Energy damage over time.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P482297281" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2539714258" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P434868702" "Your {PowerName} effect reduces {PlayerDest} regeneration rate slightly due to Disintegration."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1124785590" "{PlayerSource}'s Disintegration effect reduces your regeneration rate with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P3729946649" "Disintegrate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Charged Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1295646782" "Charged Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2815878953" "Ranged, High DMG(Energy), Foe Knockdown, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P573559485" "By charging up your Beam Rifle, you're able to launch a concentrated blast of energy at your foe to cause High Energy damage. The impact strikes with such force that it can knock your target off of their feet. Charge Shot causes additional damage if the target is suffering from the Disintegrating effect. In addition, targets already affected by the Disintegrating effect have a chance to spread to 3 nearby targets. This Disintegrate Spread effect can only hit targets that aren't already affected by the Disintegrating effect. Disintegrate Spread causes Minor Energy damage over time. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1234913844" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with their {PowerName} attack for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P935782005" "Your Disintegrate effect causes {PowerName} to deal {Damage} points of additional energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2071389446" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of additional energy damage due to your Disintegrating effect."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Cutting Beam 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P290039893" "Cutting Beam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2096597985" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -Def(All), Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2882213667" "You fire a constant stream of energy from your weapon and sweep it in a broad arc blasting all foes in a wide cone in front of you. Cutting beam deals Moderate Energy damage and reduces the targets' Defense. This power will cause Minor Energy damage over time if the target is suffering from the Disintegrating effect. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3100956268" "-Def"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P52378253" "Your defense has been reduced by the Cutting Beam!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P15983127" "Your {PowerName} sears {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduces their defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3469146276" "{PlayerSource} sears you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduces your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disintegrate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2034489808" "Ranged, High DoT(Energy), Foe -Regen, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P965636083" "You fire a stream of energy at your foe which causes them to slowly disintegrate and suffer High Energy damage over time. Even after the damage over time effect wears off the target will have their regeneration rate reduced and suffer from the Disintegration effect for an additional period of time. Using Beam Rifle powers on targets affected by Disintegrate will inflict additional effects. Additionally if Single Shot, Charged Shot, Lancer Shot and Penetrating Ray are used on a target suffering from Disintegrating, they have a chance to cause this effect to spread to up 3 nearby targets that aren't already suffering from Disintegrating. Targets affected by this Disintegrate Spread will also suffer some Minor Energy damage over time. Damage: High, Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Aim 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2468750317" "Self +To-hit, +DMG"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4115236128" "You activate {PowerName} and increase the power of your next few attacks."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1102956951" "You quickly take aim and are more accurate and more deadly for a short while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lancer Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P937537777" "Lancer Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P464449426" "Superior DMG(Energy), Foe Stun, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1768959030" "You charge up your Beam Rifle and deliver an incredibly focused ray of energy at a nearby foe that deals Superior Energy damage and will briefly stun the target. Lancer Shot will cause additional damage if the target is suffering from the Disintegrating effect. In addition, targets already affected by the Disintegrating effect have a chance to spread to 3 nearby targets. This Disintegrate Spread effect can only hit targets that aren't already affected by the Disintegration effect. Disintegrate Spread causes Minor Energy damage over time. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3540767336" "You have disoriented by the Lancer Shot's impact."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P557326348" "Your {PowerName} pierces {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3205082252" "{PlayerSource} pierces you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P269416868" "Your {PowerName} melts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduces their Defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Penetrating Ray 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1466089441" "Penetrating Ray"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P200988667" "Sniper, Extreme Dmg(Energy), Foe Knockdown, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2649633437" "You take careful aim at your target and deliver a punishing supercharged shot from your Beam Rifle. This causes Extreme Energy damage and may knock the target off their feet. If the target is also suffering from the Disintegrating effect it will also suffer additional damage over time. Like all Sniper attacks it will be interrupted if you're attacked. In addition, targets already affected by the Disintegrating effect will cause this effect to spread to 3 nearby targets. This Disintegrate Spread effect can only hit targets that aren't already affected by the Disintegrating effect. Disintegrate Spread causes Minor Energy damage over time. If you have more than 97% To-Hit, this attack becomes instant-cast. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4267120592" "You obliterate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3992926182" "{PlayerSource} snipes you for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Piercing Beam 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4113413988" "Piercing Beam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2335393485" "Narrow Ranged (Cone), High DMG(Energy), Foes -Res, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1727775688" "You release a supercharged beam in a narrow cone of energy that pierces through up to 3 enemies. Piercing Beam deals High Energy damage and briefly reduces their damage resistance. If a target struck by Piercing Beam is suffering from the Disintegrating effect it will immediately suffer additional damage. Damage: High, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3450006853" "-Res"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3269849711" "Your damage resistance has been reduced by the Piercing Beam."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Overcharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P148366414" "Overcharge"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2319771172" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Extreme DMG(Energy), Foe Minor DoT (Energy), -Def(All), Disorient, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P678328831" "You overcharge your Beam Rifle and release a massive blast of energy at a group of distant foes causing Extreme Energy damage, causing Minor Energy damage over time, reducing the defense of all affected foes and potentially stunning affected foes. If Overcharge strikes a target suffering from the Disintegrating effect they will be affected by a longer stun. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4162463289" "Disorient, Minor DoT(Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P128734841" "You have been disoriented and are suffering energy damage over time from the Overcharge."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3155730297" "You devastate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduce their defense greatly!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P808108979" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and greatly reduces your defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3791667234" "Your {PowerName} causes {Damage} additional energy damage!"

