"P3529055955" "You snipe {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce their chance to hit!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4099573449" "{PlayerSource} snipes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduces your chance to hit!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Pit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1659198204" "Dark Pit"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3003499966" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P3674184750" "Envelops a targeted foe and any nearby enemies in a pit of Negative Energy. The attack deals no damage, but Disorients all affected foes for a good while. Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tenebrous Tentacles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2726905308" "Tenebrous Tentacles"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1227418640" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Negative/Smash), Foe Immobilize, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P3096869253" "You can create a cone shaped rift to the Netherworld that allows its native creatures to slip their oily Tentacles into our reality. These creatures will snare all foes within range, Immobilizing them while the Tentacles drain their life and reduce their chance to hit. Damage: Moderate(DoT)Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3411616425" "Immobilize, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2600012039" "The Tenebrous Tentacles are holding you immobile and reducing your chance to hit."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1513428947" "Your {PowerName} entangles {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3534711131" "{PowerName} entangles you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1852627711" "Your {PowerName} entangles {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduces their chance to hit!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3880016683" "{PowerName} entangles you for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduces your chance to hit!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P362106426" "You Immobilized {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2175482535" "{PlayerSource} immobilized you with a {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Night Fall 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3659140167" "Night Fall"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3882765386" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P1124249292" "Unleashes a cone shaped burst of particles from the Netherworld. All targets within the modest range of this power take Negative Energy damage and have a reduced chance to hit. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1717254720" "Night Fall has reduced your chance to hit."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3443264550" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce their chance to hit!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1529730299" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce your chance to hit!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Torrent 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P326798890" "Torrent"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2749718870" "Ranged (Cone), Minor DMG(Smashing), Foe -To Hit, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P883929544" "You summon a wave of mire that sweeps away foes within its arc. The attack deals minimal Negative Energy damage, but sends foes flying and reduces their chance to hit. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2631996991" "The Torrent has reduced your chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Life Drain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1678761175" "Life Drain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3887098239" "Ranged, High DMG(Negative), Target -To Hit, Self +HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P846664951" "You can tap the power of the Netherworld to steal some life from a target foe and reduce their chance to hit. Some of that stolen life is transferred to you in the form of Hit Points. Damage: High Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2299365496" "Your chance to hit has been reduced by the Life Drain."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P368952603" "You drain {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce their chance to hit."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3467427143" "You gain {Damage} hit points from your {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blackstar 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P888501034" "Blackstar"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P466999421" "PBAoE, Extreme DMG(Negative/Smash), Foe -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P1997327489" "You can unleash a devastating blast of Negative Energy around yourself, dealing massive Negative Energy and Smashing damage and severely reducing affected foes' chance to hit.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1620961953" "Your chance to hit has been reduced by the Blackstar."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P90837049" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2089215592" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P439289850" "You devastate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for an amazing {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce their chance to hit."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P792350470" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with a mighty {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage, reducing your chance to hit!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Dual Pistols 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2937018680" "Dual Pistols"
// DisplayHelp :
"P484656202" "You're a master of akimbo pistols, wielding a high caliber firearm in each hand.  Your attacks primarily deal lethal damage and you have a wide variety of attacks, however your strength lies within your ability to use your "Swap Ammo" power to change out your ammo mid-battle.  Doing so can change your secondary damage type and effects making you an incredibly versatile ranged combatant."
// SetAccountTooltip :
"P2902238841" "You need to either have purchased the Going Rogue expansion, be a VIP player or have purchased the Dual Pistols power set to gain access to this feature."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Pistols 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2292338111" "Pistols"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P940166448" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe -Defense"
// Power Help Text :
"P1451108481" "Quickly fires a round from one of your heavy automatic pistols. Damage is average, but the fire rate is very fast.  If standard ammo is used, Pistols will also reduce the target's Defense.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Fast  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from -Defense to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1424371251" "You shoot {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4236434635" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1597893855" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Standard Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of lethal damage and reduce the target's defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P821341164" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Standard Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus lethal damage and reduces your defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1277365587" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Incendiary Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of fire damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4056626196" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Incendiary Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus fire damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3029045350" "Your Incendiary Rounds causes {PlayerDest} to suffer an additional {Damage} points of fire damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3894084503" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their Incendiary Rounds causing you to suffer an additional {Damage} points of fire damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3032004507" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Cryo Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of cold damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4251115593" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Cryo Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus cold damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1339705472" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Chemical Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P682794024" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Chemical for {Damage} points of bonus toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dual Wield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2558716359" "Dual Wield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P684893882" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1313375634" "Dual Wield fires both pistols in rapid succession at its desired target.  This power is slower than Pistols, but deals more damage, and the target may get knocked back by the force of the impact. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2211841663" "Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1018046219" "The secondary effect placed on you by a Dual Pistols attack varies depending on the type of ammo used.  If you were struck with Cryo Rounds, you will suffer from a minor slow effect. If you were struck with Incendiary Rounds you will suffer some damage over time.  If you were struck with Chemical Rounds you will have your damage output slightly decreased."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1486918477" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Standard Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2396128565" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Standard Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2879437270" "Your Standard Rounds knock {PlayerDest} off their feet!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P82827437" "{PlayerSource} has knocked you off your feet with their Standard Rounds!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1235441050" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Cryo Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of cold damage reducing their attack and movement speed!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P20259028" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Cryo Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus cold damage reducing  your attack and movement speed!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P637584215" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Chemical Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of toxic damage and slightly reduce their damage output!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1968418963" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Chemical for {Damage} points of bonus toxic damage and slightly decreases your damage output!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Empty Clips 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2180154381" "Empty Clips"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3690162894" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe -Defense, Knockdown/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1927847847" "You empty the clips of both your pistols in an arc of suppression fire. This attack can blast multiple foes in the affected cone area, and has a small chance of knocking some foes down.  Affected targets will have their defense reduced slightly as well if Standard Ammo is equipped. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockdown to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Swap Ammo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2191038984" "Swap Ammo"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P580779526" "Change Secondary Damage/Effects"
// Power Help Text :
"P3819777840" "By purchasing this power, you will be granted the Cryo Ammunition, Incendiary Ammunition and Chemical Ammunition toggles.   Activating these toggles will change your secondary damage type on most Dual Pistols attacks from lethal (Standard Rounds) to cold (Cryo Rounds), fire (Incendiary Rounds) or toxic (Chemical Rounds).  These toggles are mutually exclusive and only one can be active at a time.  If no Swap Ammo toggles are active, the player will revert to Standard Ammunition.  Different ammo types also have different secondary effects.  Examine your Dual Pistols powers for more information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Cryo Ammunition 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2188224519" "Cryo Ammunition"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P550345960" "Toggle: Ammo Change (Cold), Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3493578602" "While this toggle is active you will be equipped with 'Cryo Rounds'.  Most of your Dual Pistol attacks will have their secondary damage converted to cold damage and inflict a minor slow effect on the target.  In order to earn this power, you must purchase the Swap Ammo power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Incendiary Ammunition 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2300601394" "Incendiary Ammunition"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P539806842" "Toggle: Ammo Change (Fire), Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P503116991" "While this toggle is active you will be equipped with 'Incendiary Rounds.'  Most of your Dual Pistol attacks will have their secondary damage converted to fire damage and inflict a minor damage over time effect.  In order to earn this power, you must purchase the Swap Ammo power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chemical Ammunition 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2883527643" "Chemical Ammunition"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3987627407" "Toggle: Ammo Change (Toxic), Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1926788285" "While this toggle is active you will be equipped with 'Chemical Rounds.'  Most of your Dual Pistol attacks will have their secondary damage converted to toxic damage and inflict a minor damage debuff effect on the target.  In order to earn this power, you must purchase the Swap Ammo power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Bullet Rain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1980260676" "Bullet Rain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1571581867" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P158827151" "You fire your pistols faster than the human eye can follow, causing your bullet trajectory to arc, dealing moderate Lethal damage and possibly knocking your foes back.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Suppressive Fire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1434775102" "Suppressive Fire"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3055571" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe Disorient/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P175521203" "Suppressive Fire allows the user to quickly stun their target for a short time and deal a very minor amount of Lethal damage. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Disorient effect to a Hold effect if 'Cryo Ammo', 'Incendiary Ammo' or 'Chemical Ammo' are loaded."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2363889859" "The secondary effect placed on you by a Dual Pistols attack varies depending on the type of ammo used.  If you were struck with Standard Rounds, you will suffer from a Disorient effect. If you were struck with 'Cryo Rounds', 'Incendiary Rounds', or 'Chemical Rounds' you will suffer from a hold effect."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P945171150" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Lethal damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3998416020" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1224591608" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Standard Rounds for {Damage} points of Lethal damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3965228785" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with their Standard Rounds for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3275920532" "Your {PowerName} strikes {PlayerDest}, stunning them!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P792710381" "{PlayerSource} stuns you with their {PowerName}!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3026820451" "You chill {PlayerDest} with your Cryo Rounds for {Damage} points of Cold damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2583884956" "{PlayerSource} chills you with their Cryo Rounds for {Damage} points of Cold damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1856052584" "Your {PowerName} holds {PlayerDest} in a block of ice!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3771808063" "{PlayerSource} holds you in a block of ice with their {PowerName}!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3214594652" "You singe {PlayerDest} with your Incendiary Rounds for {Damage} points of Fire damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2448347986" "{PlayerSource} singes you with their Incendiary Rounds for {Damage} points of Fire damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2777463471" "Your {PowerName} holds {PlayerDest} in a cloud of choking smoke!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P316235348" "{PlayerSource} holds you in a cloud of choking smoke with their {PowerName}!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P990937941" "You hit {PlayerDest} with your Chemical Rounds for {Damage} points of Toxic damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1787383232" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their Chemical rounds for {Damage} points of Toxic damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4005009000" "Your {PowerName} holds {PlayerDest} with a cloud of noxious vapors!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1689456766" "{PlayerSource} holds you with a noxious cloud of vapors with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Executioner's Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2457212500" "Executioner's Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4159312437" "High DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe -Defense, Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2484394949" "Executioner's Shot is a deadly ranged attack.  Foes struck by this attack will suffer lethal damage and will likely be knocked back by the impact of this attack.  Targets struck by Executioner's Shot while no special ammunition is equipped will have their defenses reduced for a short time.  Damage: High, Recharge: Slow  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Piercing Rounds 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1233880528" "Piercing Rounds"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P991601179" "Narrow Ranged (Cone), Superior DMG(Lethal/Special), Foes -Res(All)/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P576138898" "You fire your pistols with deadly precision in a very narrow cone, piercing up to three enemies.  Piercing Rounds deals Superior lethal damage and reduces targets' Damage Resistance for a short time. Damage: High Recharge: Long  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from a resistance debuff to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3050567635" "The secondary effect placed on you by a Dual Pistols attack varies depending on the type of ammo used.  If you were struck by 'Standard Rounds' you will have your resistance reduced, 'Cryo Rounds' will inflict a minor slow effect, 'Incendiary Rounds' will cause some damage over time and 'Chemical Rounds' will slightly reduce your damage output."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2437140420" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Standard Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of lethal damage and reduce their damage resistance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2706707774" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Standard Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus lethal damage and reduce their damage resistance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hail of Bullets 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2117656133" "Hail of Bullets"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1200851128" "PBAoE, Superior DMG(Lethal/Special), Self +Def(Melee, Ranged, AoE), Foe Knockdown/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1217531062" "You fire a hail of bullets at all enemies around you dealing Extreme lethal damage.  Enemies that are struck have a chance to be knocked down.  Having Standard Rounds will dramatically increase this chance to knockdown your foes.  If you hit at least one target you will gain a moderate melee, ranged and AoE Defense bonus for a brief period.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from a guaranteed knockdown effect to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P129937747" "You devastate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P907587563" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Electrical Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3545884191" "Electrical Blast"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1199603259" "Electrical Blast endows you with ranged electrical attack powers. Electrical powers can drain foes' Endurance and can often temporarily halt their Endurance recovery. This can be quite effective against higher level foes and Bosses. Some Electrical Blast powers can even sometimes transfer this Endurance back to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Charged Bolts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P406048882" "Charged Bolts"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1298334033" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P3154574924" "You can quickly hurl small bolts of electricity at foes, dealing some damage and draining some Endurance. Some of this Endurance may transfer back to you. Charged Bolts deals light damage but recharges quickly. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1416730328" "You shock {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1226085207" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2154700027" "Your {PowerName} drains some endurance from {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P456748222" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with their {PowerName} and drains some of your Endurance!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1051884142" "You recover some of the Endurance you drained."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3269743464" "Lightning Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1519530153" "Ranged, High DMG(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2907957244" "You can send a large blast of electrical energy at a foe, dealing heavy damage and draining some Endurance. Some of this Endurance may transfer back to you. Lightning Bolt deals more damage than Charged Bolts, but recharges more slowly. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ball Lightning 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2138267515" "Ball Lightning"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P256474272" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1307115454" "Hurls a highly charged ball of lightning that explodes on contact. Ball Lightning deals good damage in an area of effect, and drains some Endurance from each target it hits. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1831456333" "DoT(Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2467806480" "The Ball Lightning is continuing to electrocute you."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1428594006" "You hit {PlayerDest} with {Damage} points of energy damage from your {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2374480795" "{PlayerSource} hits you for {Damage} points of energy damage with their {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P115594690" "Your {PowerName} deals an additional {Damage} points of energy damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1304278633" "{PowerName} continues to electrocute you for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Short Circuit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2973226331" "Short Circuit"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1862125547" "PBAoE, Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe -End, -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P3033630842" "Releases a burst of electrical energy around you, shocking all nearby foes. This highly accurate discharge deals Moderate damage over time, drains a lot of Endurance from the targets and renders them unable to recover Endurance for quite a while. Additionally, Short Circuit deals extra damage to most robots and mechanical foes. Short Circuit is very effective when used with your other Endurance draining powers. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2867007302" "DoT(Energy), -Recovery"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1469494981" "The Short Circuit is continuing to electrocute you.  Your Endurance recovery is greatly reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P689159219" "Your {PowerName} shocks {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P377575083" "{PlayerSource} electrocutes you for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3810503626" "Your {PowerName} drains {PlayerDest} Endurance!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1788514463" "Your {PowerName} deals an extra {Damage} points of energy damage to {PlayerDest}!"

