"P3017513223" "Zapp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P722481217" "Sniper, Extreme DMG(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1834245689" "A focused electrical blast that can travel great distances with high Accuracy. Zapp drains Endurance, and is best fired from a distance, as it can be interrupted. Some of the Endurance you drain may transfer back to you.  If you have more than 97% To-Hit, this attack becomes instant-cast.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P283770072" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage."

