"P4212295513" "Dehydrate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2217054625" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Cold/Smash), Foe -Speed, -Defense, Light DoT(Cold), Self +Heal Over Time, +/- Tidal Power"
// Power Help Text :
"P3192312053" "You rapidly dehydrate your target, causing Moderate Cold and Smashing damage, reducing their movement speed and defense as well as causing a measure of Cold damage over time. You are then healed over time for a moderate amount of health.  Dehydrate grants 1 stack of Tidal Power if you have 2 or less.  Dehydrate will consume all stacks of Tidal Power if you have 3, but the power's heal over time effect is increased by 50%.  NOTE: This power will grant a regeneration buff in PvP zones instead of a heal over time.  Damage: Moderate, Light DoT, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P953118727" "Foe -Defense and -Speed"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P30930399" "Your movement speed and defense has been reduced by the Dehydrate!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1044265723" "You dehydrate {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Cold damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2886553498" "{PlayerSource} dehydrates for {Damage} points of cold damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
